EXPORTS
    ; The four entry points COM and regsvr32 look for. STDAPI does not imply
    ; dllexport, so they have to be listed here or the DLL loads and then fails
    ; to produce a class with a bare "Class not registered".
    ;
    ; No LIBRARY statement: the output name carries a version and is decided by
    ; the build, so naming the library here only makes the linker complain that
    ; the two disagree.
    DllGetClassObject   PRIVATE
    DllCanUnloadNow     PRIVATE
    DllRegisterServer   PRIVATE
    DllUnregisterServer PRIVATE
